Architecture: all
Maintainer: Ehsan Enaloo <19691857+ehsanenaloo@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: openmediavault (>= 8.5.10), python3 (>= 3.11), h340-usb-backup (>= 0.5.0)
Recommends: h340-leds, acer-h340-usb-backup-dkms
Homepage: https://www.openmediavault.org
Description: openmediavault Acer H340 USB Backup plugin
 Settings pages for the Acer Aspire easyStore H340 in OpenMediaVault: the
 destination, free-space reserve, run name and skipped names of the one-touch USB
 copy (service in the h340-usb-backup package), the front lamps, the power
 button and a status page.
 The settings pages also cover the front lamps (h340-leds package) and show
 the service state, each bay and the last copy. The button itself needs the kernel
 module from the acer-h340-usb-backup-dkms package.
